* SSM2164 / AS2164 quad voltage-controlled amplifier
* Pin order follows the 16-pin DIP/SOIC datasheet numbering:
* 1 MODE, 2 IIN1, 3 VC1, 4 IOUT1, 5 IOUT2, 6 VC2, 7 IIN2, 8 GND,
* 9 VEE, 10 IIN3, 11 VC3, 12 IOUT3, 13 IOUT4, 14 VC4, 15 IIN4, 16 VCC.
* Positive input current entering IIN produces positive output current sourced
* from IOUT. Gain is unity at VC=0 and follows the typical -33 mV/dB law.
* Idealized behavioral model: bandwidth, distortion, and noise are not modeled.
* Output compliance is approximated by antiparallel diode clamps to ground.
* MODE is present for pin compatibility.
.subckt SSM2164 MODE IIN1 VC1 IOUT1 IOUT2 VC2 IIN2 GND VEE IIN3 VC3 IOUT3 IOUT4 VC4 IIN4 VCC PARAMS: RVC=5k
XCH1 IIN1 VC1 IOUT1 GND SSM2164_CH PARAMS: RVC={RVC}
XCH2 IIN2 VC2 IOUT2 GND SSM2164_CH PARAMS: RVC={RVC}
XCH3 IIN3 VC3 IOUT3 GND SSM2164_CH PARAMS: RVC={RVC}
XCH4 IIN4 VC4 IOUT4 GND SSM2164_CH PARAMS: RVC={RVC}
RMODE MODE VEE 1G
BBIAS VCC VEE I=6m
.ends SSM2164

.subckt SSM2164_CH IIN VC IOUT GND PARAMS: RVC=5k
VSENSE IIN IN 0
RIN IN GND 1
RCONTROL VC GND {RVC}
BOUT GND IOUT I={I(VSENSE)*min(max(exp(-V(VC,GND)/(33m*20/ln(10))),1e-5),10)}
DCOMPH IOUT GND SSM2164_COMP
DCOMPL GND IOUT SSM2164_COMP
.ends SSM2164_CH

.model SSM2164_COMP D(IS=1n N=1 RS=0.1)
